@startuml 10-online-payment-webhook-activity
' SRS 2.2 Online Payment - BF-02 / UC12 Pay by Bank Transfer, UC13 Choose COD
title Online Payment and Webhook Confirmation (BF-02)

|Customer|
start
:Open Payment page (/payment?orderId=...);
if (Choose payment method?) then (Cash on Delivery - COD)
  :Click "Thanh toán khi nhận hàng (COD)";
  |System (CMS)|
  :Create CASH payment COD-<code> (PENDING);
  :orders = CONFIRMED;
  :Push order to Barista queue;
  |Customer|
  :Redirect to e-Bill (/bill?orderId=...);
  stop
else (VietQR Bank Transfer)
  :Scan VietQR with Mobile Banking app\n(Transfer content = Order code);
  :Confirm transfer on Banking app;
endif

|Bank / SePay Hub|
:Bank records successful transfer;
:SePay Hub catches balance transaction;
:Dispatch Webhook POST to Payment Gateway;

|Payment Gateway (Cloudflare Worker)|
:Validate Webhook authorization & API Key;
:Store transaction record into D1 database;
:Match order code and transfer amount;
:Build signed payload with HMAC-SHA256 signature;
:POST callback to CMS (/payment/callback);

|System (CMS)|
:Verify HMAC-SHA256 signature;
if (Signature valid and amount matches?) then (yes)
  :payments status = SUCCESS, record transaction_code;
  :orders status = CONFIRMED;
  :Award Aura loyalty points to customer;
  :Push order to Barista queue;
  :Return HTTP 200 {success: true};
else (mismatch / invalid)
  :Log discrepancy (OVERPAID / UNDERPAID / UNMATCHED);
  :Record unverified payment attempt;
  :Return HTTP 400 error;
endif

|Customer|
:Client-side status polling checks order status;
:Detect order updated to CONFIRMED;
:Automatically redirect to e-Bill (/bill?orderId=...);
stop
@enduml
